/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Animal activists are among the most passionate people on Earth. We sacrifice our time and energy, often on a daily basis, to advocate for those who most people don't even view as victims. Conversely, animal rights, particularly farmed animal rights, receives less than 0.1% of nonprofit funding. By taking these extra steps, we are helping to channel more funds where they are desperately needed, and leveraging the time dedicated to this important cause. Should you have any questions about the information provided in this document, please reach out to Hello@Activism.wtf. Thank you for your valuable work.)
/E (Animal activists are among the most passionate people on Earth. We sacrifice our time and energy, often on a daily basis, to advocate for those who most people don't even view as victims. Conversely, animal rights, particularly farmed animal rights, receives less than 0.1% of nonprofit funding. By taking these extra steps, we are helping to channel more funds where they are desperately needed, and leveraging the time dedicated to this important cause. Should you have any questions about the information provided in this document, please reach out to Hello@Activism.wtf. Thank you for your valuable work.)
